            "review_text": "Raymondale\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1361 contributions\n0\nenglish tea\nDec 2023 • Solo\nbeen here last year December when i visited coffee aprtment. this cute english tea room located at the apartment.ordered assam tea one pot and tiramisu. very nice tea and delicious cake.the decor here beautiful and elegant. there are many teapots and teacups, all with good designed. also,you can see the passers- by outside of the apartment while enjoying your tea.cuz i had other program,i cant stay longer here, sigh! will come here again for sure.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 19, 2024",
