            "review_text": "Bryant Perez\nNaga, Philippines26 contributions\n0\nAfternoon Delight! ✔️\nSep 2019 • Family\nIf you enjoy having afternoon tea time! You'll definitely love this place! You'll just need to take the elevator with a minimal fee or a flight of stairs up to 4th floor. LoL! The place is nice and so are the stuff. You'll get to choose your own tea cup and a variety of tea leaves to choose from. I personally recommend ordering \"Morning Sunrise\" tea leaves. It's refreshing ang a perfect pair for any dessert the store can offer. It's a little bit expensive but worth the try. \n\nAmbiance: 🌟🌟🌟🌟\nPresentation: 🌟🌟🌟🌟\nPrice: 🌟🌟🌟\nService: 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\nTaste: 🌟🌟🌟🌟\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2019",
