            "review_text": "gracefromsingapore\nSingapore, Singapore13 contributions\n0\nBeautiful, bright and lovely sweet cafe\nJun 2019\nI enjoyed one afternoon here. It's a nice place to sit and rest too. There are tables that overlook the boulevard. There's a wide selection of teas here for tea-lovers. And the biz idea of getting patrons to choose their cups and sauces to pour tea in was rather interesting. I went during a weekday. Though nice setting, the place can be cram.\nWritten June 16, 2019",
