            "review_text": "Ngocanh252\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam129 contributions\n0\nIts was like in a fairy tale\nApr 2019 • Friends\nThat was when i firstly step in the shop. It was so beautiful with princes' style decoration. All the authentic chair and table, all the tea pot and tea cup made the place brighten in beautiful shinny color. \n\n\"your menu is on the wall\", oh my God. And you would see around 20 types of tea in the tea jars standing on the shelves. I was trying ginger tea and English breakfast tea. They served the 2 big tea pots boiling on top of the candle. They brought along with honey and fresh milk, and the small filter. What an English style of tea enjoying!!!\n\n\" You can choose your tea cup now\" . The tea cups were hanging on the wall, you choose the style you like. I took the small yellow one coz i wanted to drink the tea being hot always. \n\nWe ordered for macha cakes, chocolate and some other sweets. They served the cake on the cute 3 story tower. It was the best tea break i had with friend untill now.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 13, 2019",
