            "review_text": "Rob\nHardingstone, United Kingdom254 contributions\n0\nBest place in apartment cafe block\nMar 2019 • Couples\nI visited a few of the little cafes in the apartment cafe block. This was my favourite cafe in the apartment block in terms of decoration and uniqueness. Lots of different flavours of tea to chose from e.g. cherry and rose combination and baileys flavoured tea. You can pick your own style of tea cup and there’s several choices of mini desserts to chose from. Option to sit outside but nicely air conditioned inside and lots of books and decorations to look at. Relaxing and cute atmosphere. We had the scones and two teas for 300,000 (roughly £9). The only drawback is they didn’t provide soap in their toilet. Worth going before the lunch rush hour or booking a table as it’s very small. You must take your shoes off before you enter.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2019",
